/site/
/docpages
# GoReleaser output. Go stamps a build "+dirty" while untracked files exist,
# and such a docpages has no version to build the .templ files of a site with.
/dist/
# pnpm dependencies of the TypeScript checks.
/web/node_modules/
# templ generate output of docs templates, which the site builds itself.
# Committed, it makes go mod tidy of the docs module require templ directly.
/docs/template_templ.go
/example/*/docs/template_templ.go
